---
title: OpsNow — What It Does
---
flowchart TB
    classDef center fill:#5B57D1,stroke:#3F3BA8,color:#FFFFFF,font-weight:bold
    classDef note fill:#F5F6FA,stroke:#D1D5DB,stroke-dasharray: 3 3

    CENTER["OpsNow<br/>IT Service Management Platform"]:::center

    TIX["Ticket Management<br/>Raise, triage, assign,<br/>resolve & track issues"]
    SLA["SLA Management<br/>Response & resolution clocks,<br/>breach / at-risk detection"]
    ASSET["Asset Management<br/>Inventory, assignment history,<br/>link to tickets"]
    KB["Knowledge Base<br/>Self-service articles,<br/>full-text search, feedback"]
    DASH["Dashboard & Analytics<br/>Ticket, SLA, category and<br/>agent performance metrics"]
    AUDIT["Audit Log<br/>Append-only trail of every<br/>sensitive action"]
    AI["AI Assistant (optional)<br/>Triage, draft replies,<br/>resolution summaries — advisory only"]

    ROLES["Four roles, one system<br/>Employee → Support Agent → Team Lead → Administrator<br/>each seeing more of the same data,<br/>enforced on the backend"]:::note

    CENTER --> TIX
    CENTER --> SLA
    CENTER --> ASSET
    CENTER --> KB
    CENTER --> DASH
    CENTER --> AUDIT
    CENTER --> AI

    TIX -.-> ROLES
    SLA -.-> ROLES
    ASSET -.-> ROLES
    KB -.-> ROLES
    DASH -.-> ROLES
